{"w":2400,"h":3170,"lines":[{"x":0.097706390883301047,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.047161103789635672,"w":0.11744710286458332,"h":0.017596397038889933,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.094894923045956148,"t":"Now, you're free to wander around on your own until 4.30, but then at the end of our visit we'll","x":0.099755478075957457,"w":0.72180653889973967,"h":0.015742658741466631},{"x":0.099808053664021179,"t":"all meet together at the bottom of the Great Staircase. We'll then go on to the long gallery,","y":0.11191860494195371,"w":0.69097890218098956,"h":0.013081394761142673,"c":1},{"x":0.097888665405318515,"c":1,"t":"where there's a wonderful collection of photographs showing the family who owned the castle","y":0.12776025225110277,"w":0.71976969401041668,"h":0.016135096625198742},{"w":0.69683690388997399,"y":0.14301043021136295,"t":"a hundred years ago having tea and cakes in the conservatory - and we'll then take you to","x":0.099759970136750642,"h":0.015657069931270917,"c":1},{"t":"the same place, where afternoon tea will be served to you.","h":0.016082019986414342,"y":0.15991727259162014,"w":0.45503494262695315,"x":0.097817937088639673,"c":1},{"t":"Q15","w":0.036468331019083755,"x":0.82917466356915304,"y":0.15988372118560512,"c":1,"h":0.013081394761142673},{"y":0.20784883709298885,"c":1,"w":0.68330134073893223,"x":0.099808069489778675,"t":"Now if you can take a look at your plans you'll see Branley Castle has four towers, joined","h":0.014548639243333494},{"x":0.095969290123992204,"t":"together by a high wall, with the river on two sides.","y":0.22523659287385478,"w":0.39539347330729174,"h":0.014588988391382784,"c":1},{"t":"Don't miss seeing the Great Hall. That's near the river in the main tower, the biggest one,","y":0.24854651158269225,"x":0.097888676482466505,"w":0.68905949910481779,"c":1,"h":0.01612225842400683},{"w":0.48560460408528644,"y":0.26453488382180468,"c":1,"x":0.097888676827566592,"h":0.014644926654803658,"t":"which was extended and redesigned in the eighteenth century."},{"t":"If you want to get a good view of the whole castle, you can walk around the walls. Ihe","x":0.097888678405792948,"y":0.28924418617030878,"h":0.014541302870500594,"w":0.666026865641276,"c":1},{"x":0.82917466547051044,"t":"Q16","y":0.28779069780474842,"w":0.03646832784016929,"h":0.013081394761142673,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.016030175001463309,"x":0.097839624483742865,"y":0.30386291573846091,"t":"starting point's quite near the main entrance - walk straight down the path until you get to the","w":0.72367965698242187},{"y":0.32113564660153848,"c":1,"x":0.097888675477564482,"t":"south gate, and it's just there. Don't go on to the north gate - there's no way up from there.","w":0.70057581583658846,"h":0.014620167223813096},{"w":0.70259587605794271,"t":"There'll shortly be a show in which you can see archers displaying their skill with a bow and","x":0.10167926624323476,"h":0.016363367748561286,"y":0.34402354889282227,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"arrow. The quickest way to get there is to take the first left after the main entrance and follow. Q17","x":0.097888678268593876,"y":0.36046511623493105,"h":0.015988372176979571,"w":0.76775431315104181},{"y":0.37790697686710506,"t":"the path past the bridge, then you'll see it in front of you at the end.","w":0.51823415120442706,"h":0.014534883469061177,"x":0.097888682467569238,"c":1},{"y":0.39856851846426478,"t":"If you like animals there's also a display of hunting birds - falcons and eagles and so on. If","x":0.097840001735504903,"w":0.70067459106445318,"c":1,"h":0.018633309975031431},{"t":"you go from the main entrance in the direction of the south gate, but turn right before you get Q18","y":0.41703470015937083,"x":0.097888678268873638,"h":0.016104834764161802,"w":0.7677543131510417,"c":1},{"t":"there instead of going through it, you'll see it on your right past the first tower.","h":0.014551390157512945,"c":1,"w":0.59884836832682287,"y":0.4331230283177756,"x":0.095969289839775443},{"y":0.45772870686050715,"t":"At 3 pm there's a short performance of traditional dancing on the outdoor stage. That's right","x":0.097888666350819442,"w":0.7082533772786459,"h":0.014655013941816009,"c":1},{"x":0.82917466357448466,"w":0.036468331019083644,"h":0.011627907256598791,"t":"Q19","y":0.45784883703707524,"c":1},{"w":0.70836039225260417,"h":0.017202477199421917,"t":"at the other side of the castle from the entrance, and over the bridge. It's about ten minutes'","x":0.097837468175623984,"y":0.47236197500767152,"c":1},{"x":0.099808062619732824,"w":0.084452972412109389,"c":1,"y":0.49116719265193609,"t":"walk or so.","h":0.010410094637223977},{"w":0.71209213256835935,"t":"And finally the shop. It's actually inside one of the towers, but the way in is from the outside.","h":0.014558726530345845,"y":0.51451104078356136,"c":1,"x":0.097888674500369269},{"w":0.036468331019083755,"t":"Q20","y":0.51453488354680332,"x":0.82917466356915304,"h":0.01162790725659868,"c":1},{"t":"Just take the first left after the main entrance, go down the path and take the first right. It's got","x":0.097888673526518352,"y":0.53052325593796035,"c":1,"h":0.014587154448596484,"w":0.72360844930013024},{"h":0.013081394761142673,"t":"some lovely gifts and souvenirs.","c":1,"x":0.099808069554250478,"w":0.24952013651529947,"y":0.5450581396107077},{"c":1,"t":"Right, so we're just arriving ...","x":0.099808066660518807,"y":0.57255520475697486,"h":0.013249211356466839,"w":0.23032628377278644},{"w":0.14971209208170572,"y":0.62354651157526997,"c":1,"h":0.015988372176979571,"x":0.097888675553516963,"t":"SECTION 3"},{"w":0.051883366902669287,"x":0.097858700329977205,"h":0.010350804374045008,"c":1,"y":0.655435062908581,"t":"TUTOR."},{"t":"ROSIE:","x":0.097876554273372565,"h":0.010237482594390723,"w":0.046089502970377602,"c":1,"y":0.68601497946425238},{"x":0.097888675009986229,"w":0.049904031753540037,"t":"TUTOR:","h":0.0087209304424490375,"c":1,"y":0.70348837197063596},{"t":"MARTIN:","y":0.71920160270790312,"x":0.097815713664175144,"h":0.0092712131584480328,"c":1,"w":0.055808111826578785},{"y":0.76598837208187631,"h":0.010174418548680286,"c":1,"x":0.097888676472407066,"t":"ROSIE:","w":0.046065257390340175},{"x":0.09596929178367998,"y":0.81249999971472397,"t":"MARTIN:","h":0.01162790725659868,"w":0.057581570943196617,"c":1},{"w":0.051823415756225594,"t":"TUTOR:","c":1,"x":0.095969290102840998,"y":0.84593023256655875,"h":0.010174418548680175},{"c":1,"y":0.65249090440802826,"t":"So, Rosie and Martin, let's look at what you've got for your presentation on","x":0.19186134542000788,"w":0.57787185668945307,"h":0.018205552447105422},{"y":0.67003154584092584,"t":"woolly mammoths.","x":0.19193858187579654,"h":0.013249211356466839,"w":0.14779270172119141,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.19372544933248984,"t":"OK, we've got a short outline here.","y":0.68442150144565206,"w":0.26898348490397139,"h":0.015961467129198881},{"c":1,"t":"Thanks. So it's about a research project in North America?","x":0.19193857506779086,"y":0.70189274425250592,"w":0.45297505696614582,"h":0.014826498422712886},{"c":1,"h":0.01719478643278971,"t":"Yes. But we thought we needed something general about woolly mammoths in","x":0.18996413178555968,"y":0.71654129893279894,"w":0.60855041503906249},{"t":"our introduction, to establish that they were related to our modern elephant, and","y":0.732466423784915,"x":0.19188108715820276,"h":0.017644593392260877,"c":1,"w":0.61623143513997403},{"y":0.74854667298329181,"w":0.40720807393391922,"c":1,"x":0.19177710096157871,"t":"they lived thousands of years ago in the last ice age.","h":0.016309149709033632},{"t":"Maybe we could show a video clip of a cartoon about mammoths. But that'd be a","h":0.01324921135646695,"c":1,"y":0.76593059957683152,"x":0.19001920005220152,"w":0.6257197570800781},{"w":0.67178502400716145,"t":"bit childish. Or we could have a diagram, it could be a timeline to show when they Q21","h":0.016088328075709701,"c":1,"x":0.1919385819486801,"y":0.78044164050215958},{"y":0.79651162819393917,"h":0.013081394761142673,"x":0.19001919313963672,"w":0.18234165191650392,"c":1,"t":"lived, with illustrations?"},{"c":1,"t":"Or we could just show a drawing of them walking in the ice? No, let's go with","w":0.59141993204752608,"x":0.19180236798372921,"y":0.80975341993095695,"h":0.019364106692726368},{"h":0.01324921135646695,"y":0.82839116738923846,"c":1,"x":0.19193857861821376,"t":"your last suggestion.","w":0.16122840881347658},{"t":"Good. Then you're describing the discovery of the mammoth tooth on St Paul's","x":0.19184327582908131,"c":1,"y":0.84371102196810432,"h":0.017803382271847856,"w":0.60862472534179679},{"w":0.33781188964843756,"h":0.015988372176979571,"c":1,"t":"Island in Alaska, and why it was significant.","x":0.18809981322402938,"y":0.86046511623186661},{"t":"104","x":0.095969289288922663,"y":0.9534883723483959,"h":0.013081394761142673,"w":0.036468331019083658,"c":1}]}